    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c49d6f16ffb260df6b92016",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在是“夏季集训”。\n为了即将开始的GⅠ级比赛“菊花赏”，\n这段期间要进一步提升爱丽速子的能力──",
      "source_fingerprint": "390561409e6be0d1b831d8c3397279d77d699cb212c4e287a63c9382c5064422",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032104.json",
