    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9d40664389abb4f392b78f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──本来是预定这样做的。\n不知为何，我被迫接受爱丽速子的重训。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9941811f2824b3a7822eb2e3a2ee80ac9fe2597bc04e4605b259ac007df30f5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20ffe521a1b537102f508eea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为这是为了炒热赛马娘界的气氛而举办的\n特别比赛。随着舆论的沸腾──",
      "source_fingerprint": "43d08044f0fd287a072c62d49f458dd619504f972685533fc86fe54d62c18bb9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc9a5586fd2184de8ed6866e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "甚至还出现了指责她太没有责任感的说法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f396e5861d62f4af419fded62312b3bb0203baa89962ad0ecb4229973bfc31bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e29c6257eb14f440fe95b58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果要采访的话，请先联络校方──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5ed1282046d613f4cf4b1f6a8cd567dd401bd0fbce3aaab0069bb1f4d5d4893",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032104.json",
