      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是的。还想说夏季集训里，\n怎么会有没见过的人跑进来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2d6f424513e942951906f3a5c0425fcd15bc38090006b6291fd42115e77f7a7",
